{"hymn":"FR75","parent":"E436","quality":"hand","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Ta vie Tu as livré","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":"Ta","n2":"vie","n3":"Tu","n4":"as","n5":["li","i"],"n6":["vré,","t"],"n9":"Tu","n10":"as","n11":["ver","i"],"n12":["sé","t"],"n13":"Ton","n14":"Sang","n16":"Et","n17":"Tu","n18":"m'as","n19":["ra","i"],"n20":["che","m"],"n21":["té,","t"],"n24":"Tu","n25":"m'as","n26":["ren","i"],"n27":["du","t"],"n29":["vi","i"],"n30":["vant.","t"],"n32":"Ta","n33":"vie","n34":"pour","n35":"moi","n37":"Tu","n38":"as","n39":["li","i"],"n40":["vré,","t"],"n41":"Que","n42":["T'ai","i"],"n43":["je","t"],"n44":["pré","i"],"n46":["sen","m"],"n47":["té?","t"],"n49":"Ta","n50":"vie","n51":"pour","n52":"moi","n54":"Tu","n55":"as","n56":["li","i"],"n57":["vré,","t"],"n58":"Que","n59":["T'ai","i"],"n60":["je","t"],"n61":["pré","i"],"n63":["sen","m"],"n64":["té?","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Pour moi tu enduras","L'opprobre et la douleur,","Pour que Ta gloire soit","Sans cesse dans mon cœur.","Pour moi, Seigneur, Tu fus blessé,","Et moi, qu'ai-je à donner ?"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Le trône Tu quittas","Et Tu fus humilié,","La gloire abandonnas,","Pour moi fus dépouillé.","De tout, pour moi, Tu t'es privé,","Je n'ai rien mérité."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Tu as vécu pour moi","La plus grande agonie,","De l'enfer me sauvas,","Pour me donner la vie.","Pour moi, Tu as été percé,","Et moi, qu'ai-je enduré ?"]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Des cieux Tu descendis,","M'offris Ton grand pardon,","Le plein salut gratuit,","L'amour, suprême don !","Le Saint-Esprit, Tu m'as donné,","Et moi, qu'ai-je apporté ?"]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Je me consacre à Toi,","Du monde détaché.","De peines et de joies,","Mes jours seront tissés.","Tu t'es, Seigneur, donné pour moi,","Et moi, je m'offre à Toi !"]}]}